OL,3,A'Constantly on my mind' - 9/11 agony
OL,4,Agoes on for bereaved, 25 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FTom Resta's brother John and his wife
OL,7,FSylvia, who was seven months pregnant,
OL,8,Fwere among the almost 3,000 people
OL,9,Fkilled on 11 September 2001 when
OL,10,Fhijackers flew planes into the World
OL,11,FTrade Center in New York City and the
OL,12,FPentagon in Virginia. Another crashed
OL,13,Fin a field in Pennsylvania after the
OL,14,Fpassengers fought back.
OL,16,FThe couple had been preparing their
OL,17,Funborn baby's nursery, painting it with
OL,18,Fcharacters from the children's
OL,19,Ftelevision show Blue's Clues in the
OL,20,Fdays before 9/11. They had dreamed of
OL,21,Fhaving a baby and doted on the children
OL,22,Fof friends and family.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
